{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":22,"lang":"id","title":"Dia, punyaku, dirimu, yang…","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Apa yang akan kamu pelajari","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Pelajaran ini tentang kata pendek pengganti nama dan barang: «saya bisa menasihatinya», «boleh saya buka ini?», «sarung HP ini punya saya», «perkenalkan dirimu», «saya mau yang ada tudungnya», «saya perlu cara bayar lain»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can advise him.","translation":"Saya bisa menasihatinya.","hi":"him"},{"en":"This phone case is mine.","translation":"Sarung HP ini punya saya.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"You can introduce yourself.","translation":"Kamu bisa memperkenalkan diri.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"I want the hooded one.","translation":"Saya mau yang ada tudungnya.","hi":"one"},{"en":"I need another payment method.","translation":"Saya perlu cara bayar lain.","hi":"another"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"him, her, them — setelah tindakan","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Bahasa Indonesia cukup «dia» untuk semua; bahasa Inggris membedakan: laki-laki him, perempuan her, banyak orang them. I can advise him. I want to congratulate her. Me dan you juga bisa setelah tindakan."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"tindakan","accent":true},{"text":"me / you / him / her / us / them","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can advise him.","translation":"Saya bisa menasihatinya.","hi":"him"},{"en":"I want to congratulate her.","translation":"Saya mau mengucapkan selamat padanya.","hi":"her"},{"en":"I admire them.","translation":"Saya kagum pada mereka.","hi":"them"},{"en":"I do not want to disappoint you.","translation":"Saya tidak mau mengecewakanmu.","hi":"you"},{"en":"This story can amuse them.","translation":"Cerita ini bisa menghibur mereka.","hi":"them"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I can advise he.","right":"I can advise him."},{"wrong":"I can advise his.","right":"I can advise him."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I want to support","after":".","options":["her","she","hers"],"answer":"her","why":"Setelah tindakan, untuk perempuan — her."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"it dan them — untuk barang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Satu barang setelah tindakan — it, beberapa — them: Could I unscrew it? Could I untangle them? Bukan its dan bukan they."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"tindakan","accent":true},{"text":"it (satu barang) / them (beberapa)","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Could I unscrew it?","translation":"Boleh saya buka sekrupnya?","hi":"it"},{"en":"Could I untangle them?","translation":"Boleh saya urai yang kusut ini?","hi":"them"},{"en":"Could I strain it?","translation":"Boleh saya saring ini?","hi":"it"},{"en":"I can calculate it.","translation":"Saya bisa menghitungnya.","hi":"it"},{"en":"I can round it down.","translation":"Saya bisa membulatkannya ke bawah.","hi":"it"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Could I untangle they?","right":"Could I untangle them?"},{"wrong":"Could I unscrew its?","right":"Could I unscrew it?"}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"mine, yours, ours — «punya saya» tanpa barang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kalau barangnya sudah disebut dan kamu bilang «ini punya saya», pakai kata tersendiri: mine, yours, his, hers, ours. This phone case is mine. My tidak berdiri sendiri."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"ini","accent":true},{"text":"is","accent":true},{"text":"mine / yours / his / hers / ours","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"This phone case is mine.","translation":"Sarung HP ini punya saya.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"This travel mug is yours.","translation":"Gelas perjalanan ini punyamu.","hi":"yours"},{"en":"This rain jacket is ours.","translation":"Jas hujan ini punya kita.","hi":"ours"},{"en":"This yoga mat is hers.","translation":"Matras yoga ini punya dia.","hi":"hers"},{"en":"This electric razor is his.","translation":"Alat cukur listrik ini punya dia.","hi":"his"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"This phone case is my.","right":"This phone case is mine."},{"wrong":"This phone case is me.","right":"This phone case is mine."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Kamu menunjuk matras teman perempuanmu. Bagaimana bilang itu punyanya?","optionA":"This yoga mat is her.","optionB":"This yoga mat is hers.","correct":"B","explain":"«Punya dia» (perempuan) tanpa barang — hers."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"yourself — «dirimu sendiri»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kalau tindakan tertuju pada orang itu sendiri — «perkenalkan diri», «jaga diri» — pakai yourself: You can introduce yourself. You saja tidak cukup."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"you","accent":true},{"text":"tindakan","accent":true},{"text":"yourself","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"You can introduce yourself.","translation":"Kamu bisa memperkenalkan diri.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You need to look after yourself.","translation":"Kamu perlu menjaga diri.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You should not blame yourself.","translation":"Jangan menyalahkan dirimu sendiri.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You can be yourself.","translation":"Kamu bisa jadi dirimu sendiri.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You can forgive yourself.","translation":"Kamu bisa memaafkan dirimu sendiri.","hi":"yourself"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"You can introduce you.","right":"You can introduce yourself."},{"wrong":"You need to look after you.","right":"You need to look after yourself."}]}]},{"num":"06","title":"one dan ones — supaya tidak mengulang barang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Bahasa Indonesia bilang «yang ada tudungnya»; bahasa Inggris pakai the + ciri + one (satu) atau ones (beberapa): I want the hooded one. it tidak cocok di sini."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"the","accent":true},{"text":"ciri","accent":true},{"text":"one (satu) / ones (beberapa)","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I want the hooded one.","translation":"Saya mau yang ada tudungnya.","hi":"one"},{"en":"I like the patterned ones.","translation":"Saya suka yang bermotif.","hi":"ones"},{"en":"I prefer the padded one.","translation":"Saya lebih suka yang empuk.","hi":"one"},{"en":"I want the slip-on ones.","translation":"Saya mau yang tanpa tali.","hi":"ones"},{"en":"I want the ready-to-eat one.","translation":"Saya mau yang siap makan.","hi":"one"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I want the hooded it.","right":"I want the hooded one."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Katakan: «Saya suka yang bermotif».","answer":["I","like","the","patterned","ones"],"distractors":["one","it"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"another — «yang lain, satu lagi»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kalau perlu satu pilihan baru sebagai ganti — another + satu barang: I need another payment method — «saya perlu cara bayar lain». Bahasa Indonesia menaruh «lain» di belakang, bahasa Inggris another di depan."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"another","accent":true},{"text":"satu barang","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I need another payment method.","translation":"Saya perlu cara bayar lain.","hi":"another"},{"en":"I need another meeting place.","translation":"Saya perlu tempat ketemu lain.","hi":"another"},{"en":"We use another departure gate.","translation":"Kami lewat gerbang keberangkatan lain.","hi":"another"},{"en":"I want another room type.","translation":"Saya mau tipe kamar lain.","hi":"another"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I need payment method other.","right":"I need another payment method."},{"wrong":"I need other payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."}]}]},{"num":"08","title":"Ulangan: Could I…? dan to — «supaya»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Dari pelajaran sebelumnya: Could I…? — minta dengan sopan, to + kata kerja — «supaya». Could I book a table? I use an umbrella to stay dry."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Could I book a table?","translation":"Boleh saya pesan meja?","hi":"Could I"},{"en":"Could I get some fresh air?","translation":"Boleh saya cari udara segar?","hi":"Could I"},{"en":"I use an umbrella to stay dry.","translation":"Saya pakai payung supaya tidak basah.","hi":"to stay"},{"en":"I fill the kettle to boil the water.","translation":"Saya isi teko untuk merebus air.","hi":"to boil"}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Kesalahan yang dibuat hampir semua orang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"This phone case is my.","right":"This phone case is mine."},{"wrong":"You can introduce you.","right":"You can introduce yourself."},{"wrong":"I want the hooded it.","right":"I want the hooded one."},{"wrong":"I need other payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Setelah tindakan — him (laki-laki), her (perempuan), them, it. «Punya saya» tanpa barang — mine. «Diri sendiri» — yourself. Jangan ulang barang — one atau ones. Lain — another."}]},{"num":"10","title":"Yang dibawa ke latihan","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Orang setelah tindakan — him / her / them. Barang — it / them. «Punya saya» tanpa barang — mine, yours, ours. Diri sendiri — yourself. Yang… — the … one. Lain — another."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I want to praise him.","translation":"Saya mau memujinya.","hi":"him"},{"en":"This overnight bag is yours.","translation":"Tas menginap ini punyamu.","hi":"yours"},{"en":"You can think for yourself.","translation":"Kamu bisa berpikir sendiri.","hi":"yourself"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"02","2":"02","3":"02","4":"02","5":"03","6":"03","7":"03","8":"03","9":"04","10":"04","11":"04","12":"04","13":"08","14":"08","15":"08","16":"08","17":"05","18":"05","19":"05","20":"05","21":"08","22":"08","23":"08","24":"08","25":"06","26":"06","27":"06","28":"06","29":"06","30":"08","31":"08","32":"08","33":"07","34":"07","35":"07","36":"07","37":"07","38":"08","39":"08","40":"08","41":"08","42":"08","43":"08","44":"08","45":"08","46":"08","47":"08","48":"08","49":"08","50":"08","51":"08","52":"08","53":"08","54":"08"}}
